  <li><a href="?pages/field_sigils">Field sigils</a> - <code>{open}!name{close}</code>, <code>{open}^name{close}</code> and the rest</li>
  <li><a href="?pages/level_and_occurrence_variables">Level and occurrence variables</a> - <code>$</code> and <code>%</code></li>
</ul>
